# Cabeçalhos de segurança (assets do Worker). Scripts só do próprio site e do Umami; conexões só ao
# Worker e ao Umami; mapas do OpenStreetMap; fotos dos anúncios de qualquer origem https.
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), camera=(), microphone=(), payment=(), usb=()
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' https://cloud.umami.is; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data: https:; connect-src 'self' https://aysha-leiloes-analise.leiloes.workers.dev https://cloud.umami.is https://gateway.umami.is https://api-gateway.umami.dev; font-src 'self'; frame-ancestors 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'; object-src 'none'; upgrade-insecure-requests

/data/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=900

/vendor/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=604800
